    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certifies that on 2nd August 2006, the erection of a single storey side/rear extension to house with the volume of 39.00m3, which would give a total volume increase to the original house of 44.19m3 shown on drawing number 849.01, 849.02, 849.03 and 849.04, received 2nd August 2006, was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\nFollowing the proposed erection of a single storey side/rear extension to house, the resulting building would fall within the provisions of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 1995.\r\n"
